        "toolDescription": "Call this tool to retrieve the OFFICIAL FAQ and support policies of LinguaTech Solutions.\n\nUse it for questions about support hours, response times, post-delivery support, maintenance, technical issue reporting, RAG or chatbot behavior, document and knowledge-base updates, client data handling, credentials, consultations, support boundaries, and escalation rules.\n\nAlways call this tool before answering questions about official support policies.\n\nDo NOT use this tool for service pricing, quotations, discounts, new project proposals, or detailed descriptions of services. Those belong to Projects & Service Inquiries and the services knowledge base.\n\nIf the retrieved information does not clearly answer the question, do not invent a policy or guarantee. Escalate for human review.",
